c.gov/Archives/edgar/data/314808/000031480826000152/a09302026ex991pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2026-08-05", "n": 8.77, "z": 2.48, "rz": 0.58, "earn": true, "q": "I want to thank our teams across the organization for their unwavering commitment to safe, reliable and efficient operations. Together we delivered another quarter of strong performance, highlighted by revenue efficiency of 98% and the successful startup of two drillships. These achievements helped drive solid financia…", "a": "President and Chief Executive Officer Anton Dibowitz said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/314808/000031480826000138/a06302026ex991pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2026-05-04", "n": 8.0, "z": 2.79, "rz": -1.92, "earn": true, "q": "Thank you to the entire Valaris team for a strong start to the year. We delivered safe and reliable operations for our customers, achieving revenue efficiency of 98% in the first quarter. We expect a meaningful improvement in our financial results through 2026, supported by strong project delivery and operational execu…", "a": "President and Chief Executive Officer Anton Dibowitz said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/314808/000031480826000097/a03312026ex991pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2026-02-19", "n": 3.92, "z": -1.77, "rz": 0.37, "earn": true, "q": "Our fourth quarter results capped another year of strong execution by the Valaris team. We delivered revenue efficiency of 98% for the quarter and 96% for full year 2025, marking our fifth consecutive year of revenue efficiency at or above 96%. Our employees' unwavering focus on operational excellence continues to be a…", "a": "President and Chief Executive Officer Anton Dibowitz said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/314808/000031480826000025/a12312025ex991pressrelease.htm"}, {"d": "2026-02-09", "n": 4.09, "z": null, "rz": null, "earn": false, "q": "This transaction creates a very attractive investment in the offshore drilling industry, differentiated by the best fleet, proven people, leading technologies, and unequalled customer service,", "a": "said Keelan Adamson, Transocean President and Chief Executive Officer", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/314808/000114036126004310/ef20065172_ex99-1.htm"}, {"d": "2025-10-29", "n": 4.92, "z": -0.95, "rz": 0.97, "earn": true, "q": "The Valaris team continues to deliver safe and efficient operations, which led to another quarter of strong financial results. We also continue to execute our commercial strategy having recently secured an attractive contract for VALARIS DS-12 with bp offshore Egypt. With this award, all four of our active drillships w…", "a": "President and Chief Executive Officer Anton Dibowitz said", "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/314808/000031480825000144/a09302025ex991pressrelease.htm"}], "now": {"d": "2026-11-02", "z": 2.22, "mood": "up"}, "say_do": {"mood": "up", "acts": "none", "clash": false, "agree": false}}, "score": {"value": 51, "verdict": {"it": "Nessuna convinzione chiara", "en": "No clear conviction"}, "confidence": "Media", "covered_pct": 80, "missing": ["guid"], "subs": [{"id": "insider", "name": {"it": "Insider", "en": "Insiders"}, "w": 35, "v": 50, "why": [{"it": "Nessun acquisto discrezionale negli ultimi 90 giorni.", "en": "No discretionary purchase in the last 90 days."}, {"it": "Flusso netto pesato sullo storico: +0.00 M$.", "en": "Net flow weighted by track record: +0.00 M$."}], "coverage": "Bassa"}, {"id": "guid", "name": {"it": "Guidance e tono", "en": "Guidance and tone"}, "w": 20, "v": null, "why": [{"it": "Serve l'export delle trascrizioni delle call.", "en": "Needs the export of the earnings-call transcripts."}], "coverage": "Assente"}, {"id": "market", "name": {"it": "Mercato", "en": "Market"}, "w": 15, "v": 54, "why": [{"it": "Short interest a 5.7 milioni di azioni, -13.3% rispetto alla mediana dell'ultimo anno (6.6 milioni).", "en": "Short interest at 5.7 million shares, -13.3% against the median of the last year 